Executive Performance Monitoring – Provide a single source of truth for sales, profit, and order volume through executive-level KPIs.

Trend Analysis – Enable monthly analysis of sales, profit, and order trends to identify changes in business performance.

Product & Category Analysis – Evaluate product- and category-level sales, profitability, and margin performance.

Customer Segmentation – Analyse customer performance across segments, countries, and regions.

Delivery & Shipping Analysis – Monitor on-time delivery performance and shipping costs across different shipping modes.

Returns & Refund Analysis – Track return rates and refund amounts by return reason to identify key return patterns.

Data Auditability & Refresh – Maintain visibility into data loads and support scheduled, automated data refreshes for reliable reporting.
